{"\u03b8__is__the_pretrained_vit_encoder": "The predicate \"is\" in this context signifies the identification or definition of \u03b8 as the pretrained ViT encoder. It establishes the role or function of \u03b8 within the described system."},
{"the_pretrained_vit_encoder": "The pretrained ViT encoder is a machine learning model, specifically a Vision Transformer, that has been pre-trained on a large dataset. It is used here to encode input images into a format that can be used to generate queries for selecting prompts, playing a crucial role in the dynamic selection process."},
