{"a_clustering_like_approach": "A clustering-like approach describes a method that groups similar items together based on certain criteria, much like clustering algorithms do in data analysis. In this case, the approach of selecting prompts based on cosine similarity to an input-conditioned query resembles clustering, as it groups prompts that are most similar to the query."},
