{"length_20_prompts_in_layers_3_5": "Length 20 prompts in layers 3-5 are referred to as _task-expert_ prompts within the DualPrompt method. These longer prompts are utilized in the middle to upper layers of the model to provide specialized guidance for the tasks at hand, enhancing the model's performance and adaptability.|Here is another description: The subject refers to the length 20 prompts utilized in layers 3-5 of a system, specifically within the context of DualPrompt. These prompts are part of a structured approach to enhance the performance and parameter efficiency of the system."},
