{"we__insert_prompts_into__the_same_layers_as_dualprompt_layers_1_5_for_coda_p": "Insert prompts into signifies the action of placing or embedding prompts within certain layers of a machine learning model. This is a strategic choice to influence the model's behavior or performance in a specific way."},
{"the_same_layers_as_dualprompt_layers_1_5_for_coda_p": "The same layers as DualPrompt (layers 1-5) for CODA-P refers to the specific layers within a machine learning model where prompts are being inserted. These layers are consistent with those used in DualPrompt, a previously established method, and are being applied to CODA-P, another method or model in the context."},
