{"8_and_100_prompt_components__were_chosen_with__a_hyperparameter_sweep_on_validation_data": "The predicate describes the process through which the subject (8 and 100 prompt components) was selected. It indicates that these components were not chosen arbitrarily but through a systematic approach involving a hyperparameter sweep. This process aimed to find the optimal configuration that balances performance and parameter efficiency."},
{"a_hyperparameter_sweep_on_validation_data": "The object of the triple is the method used to select the prompt components, which is a hyperparameter sweep conducted on validation data. This technique involves systematically exploring a range of hyperparameter values to identify the combination that yields the best model performance on a held-out validation dataset."},
{"8_and_100_prompt_components__have__the_best_trade_off_between_performance_and_parameter_efficiency": "The predicate indicates that the chosen configuration of 8 and 100 prompt components has been determined to provide an optimal balance. This balance is between achieving high performance in the model and maintaining efficiency in the use of parameters."},
