{"pre_fix_tuning": "Pre-fix tuning is a technique used in machine learning, particularly in the context of continual learning, where models need to adapt to new tasks without forgetting previously learned information.|Here is another description: Pre-fix tuning is a method used in machine learning to adapt models for specific tasks by adjusting certain parameters before the main training process. It is particularly employed to enhance the performance of models in dynamic learning environments."},
