{"pre_fix_tuning__works_best_for__continual_learning": "The phrase \"works best for\" indicates that pre-fix tuning is particularly effective or optimal when applied to a specific scenario or type of learning process, outperforming other methods in that context."},
{"continual_learning__is_referenced_in__65": "The phrase 'is referenced in' indicates that the subject, continual learning, is cited or mentioned within another work, providing credibility or context to the discussion."},
