{"we__are_not_worried__by_the_slight_uptick_in_forgetting": "The predicate \"are not worried\" indicates the emotional or cognitive state of the subject regarding a certain situation or outcome. In this case, it shows that the authors are not concerned about a particular aspect of their method's performance."},
