{"2017_12th_international_workshop_on_self_organizing_maps_and_learning_vector_quantization_clustering_and_data_visualization_wsom": "The 2017 12th International Workshop on Self-Organizing Maps and Learning Vector Quantization, Clustering and Data Visualization (WSOM) is an international conference dedicated to the discussion and advancement of self-organizing maps, learning vector quantization, and related data visualization techniques. It serves as a platform for researchers and practitioners to present their latest work, exchange ideas, and collaborate on future projects in these fields.|Here is another description: The 2017 12th International Workshop on Self-Organizing Maps and Learning Vector Quantization, Clustering and Data Visualization (WSOM) is a specialized conference focused on the latest research and developments in self-organizing maps, learning vector quantization, clustering techniques, and data visualization methods."},
