{"memory_efficient_experience_replay_for_streaming_learning": "Memory efficient experience replay for streaming learning is a research topic or methodology aimed at optimizing the storage and utilization of past experiences in machine learning models, particularly in the context of streaming data where continuous learning is required.|Here is another description: Memory efficient experience replay for streaming learning is a research topic or methodology focused on optimizing the storage and processing of experience replay data in the context of streaming learning algorithms. This approach aims to enhance the efficiency of machine learning models by managing the memory usage effectively while continuously learning from streaming data.|Here is another description: Memory efficient experience replay for streaming learning is a research topic or methodology presented at the 2019 International Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA). It focuses on optimizing the storage and retrieval of experiences in machine learning systems that process streaming data."},
