{"selection_and_formation_of_the_prompt": "The \"selection and formation of the prompt\" pertains to the process of choosing and structuring the prompt used in the vision transformer encoder, which is a key component of the research that the authors aim to optimize and compare with DualPrompt."},
{"formation_of_the_prompt": "The formation of the prompt refers to the process of creating and structuring the prompt used in the vision transformer encoder. This process is crucial for ensuring that the prompt is effective and compatible with the technical foundations established by prior work like DualPrompt."},
{"formation_of_the_prompt__includes__enabling_an_end_to_end_optimization_of_all_prompting_components": "The predicate \"includes\" signifies that the formation of the prompt encompasses or incorporates certain elements or processes. In this context, it indicates that the formation process is not isolated but involves additional components or steps."},
{"enabling_an_end_to_end_optimization_of_all_prompting_components": "Enabling an end-to-end optimization of all prompting components means that the formation of the prompt involves a comprehensive approach to optimizing every aspect of the prompting process. This optimization ensures that the prompt is finely tuned to achieve the best possible performance within the vision transformer encoder."},
