{"vision_transformer_encoder": "The vision transformer encoder is a component that processes visual data using transformer architecture. It takes the resulting prompt as input and operates in a manner consistent with the DualPrompt approach, allowing for a fair comparison of novel contributions in the work.|Here is another description: The vision transformer encoder is a component in our work that processes visual data using transformer architecture, focusing on the selection and formation of prompts."},
