{"lp__is__the_prompt_length_chosen_as_a_hyperparameter": "The predicate \"is\" serves as an identifier, equating _Lp_ to its definition within the context of the model's hyperparameters."},
{"the_prompt_length_chosen_as_a_hyperparameter": "The prompt length, denoted as a hyperparameter, is a configurable value in the model that determines the size or extent of the input prompt used during the model's processing."},
