{"the_rest_of_the_transformer_encoder": "The rest of the transformer encoder refers to the components of the transformer model that are not being specifically modified or trained in a particular process. In this context, it implies that while certain parts of the transformer, such as the prompts, are being trained or adjusted, the remaining sections of the encoder are left in their original state."},
