{"unmodified": "\"Unmodified\" describes the state of the rest of the transformer encoder in this scenario. It means that these parts of the model have not been altered, adjusted, or trained in any way. They retain their original configuration and parameters, serving as a stable baseline against which the effects of training the prompts can be measured.|Here is another description: The object \"unmodified\" describes the state of the evaluation data, confirming that it has remained in its original form without any changes or adjustments. This ensures that the evaluation is conducted under consistent and unaltered conditions, providing a fair assessment of the model's performance."},
