{"\u03b3_q_x_k2__is_part_of__the_sequence": "\"is part of\" indicates that the subject, \u03b3(q(x), K2), is an individual component within a larger ordered collection or sequence."},
{"\u03b3_q_x_km": "\u03b3(q(x), KM) represents a specific element within a sequence, where q(x) is a function applied to x, and KM is the M-th element in a set of K elements."},
{"\u03b3_q_x_km__is_part_of__the_sequence": "The predicate \"is part of\" indicates that the subject \u03b3(q(x), KM) is an integral component or member of a larger collection or sequence."},
{"k_____r_d_m": "The symbol '\u2208' denotes membership, indicating that the subject K is an element of the set R [D][\u00d7][M]."},
