{"expanding_our_parameters__do_not_alter__the_computation_of_weights_\u03b1_corresponding_to_previously_learned_components": "The predicate \"do not alter\" signifies that the process of expanding parameters has no impact on the existing computations within the model. Specifically, it ensures that the method used to calculate the weights of previously learned components remains unchanged."},
