{"hyperparameter_balancing_the_orthogonality_loss": "A hyperparameter balancing the orthogonality loss is a parameter that is manually set before the training process begins. Its role is to adjust the degree to which the model maintains orthogonality between different tasks, which is crucial in continual learning to prevent catastrophic forgetting."},
