{"pre_fix_tuning_over_prompt_tuning": "Pre-fix tuning over prompt-tuning is a technique or approach that is being examined in Section 3.2 of the document. It is presented as a superior method compared to prompt-tuning, particularly in the context of continual learning, as indicated by the reference to a study or source [65] that supports this claim.|Here is another description: Pre-fix tuning over prompt-tuning is a method used in machine learning implementations, specifically chosen for its effectiveness in certain scenarios."},
