{"newly_introduced_prompt_component_dimension": "The newly introduced prompt component dimension is a novel aspect of the model architecture that allows for more flexible and dynamic handling of input prompts. This dimension is being scaled alongside model capacity to evaluate its impact on performance."},
{"5_task_imagenet_r_benchmark": "The 5-task ImageNet-R benchmark is a specific evaluation metric used to assess the performance of models, particularly in the context of image recognition tasks. It consists of five distinct tasks derived from the ImageNet dataset, tailored to evaluate a model's robustness and generalization capabilities across various image-related challenges."},
