{"coda_prompt__is__continual_decomposed_attention_based_prompting": "The term \"is\" in this context signifies the identification or definition of CODA-Prompt as a specific type of method or technique\u2014namely, continual decomposed attention-based prompting. It establishes the nature or category of the subject."},
