{"our_approach__assembles__learnable_prompt_components": "The predicate \"assembles\" indicates the process by which CODA-Prompt integrates or combines various elements. In this context, it specifically refers to the method by which CODA-Prompt puts together learnable prompt components to enhance the functionality of the ViT encoder."},
{"learnable_prompt_components__are_inserted_into__a_pre_trained_vit_encoder_for_image_classification": "The action of being inserted into signifies the integration of these learnable components into an existing system, modifying its functionality to improve performance or adapt to new tasks."},
