{"coda_prompt__is_optimized_in__an_end_to_end_fashion": "The phrase \"is optimized in\" indicates that CODA-Prompt undergoes a specific optimization process. This process is crucial for enhancing the performance and efficiency of the method in continual learning scenarios."},
{"prior_sota_methods": "Prior SOTA methods refer to the state-of-the-art techniques that were previously used in the field of rehearsal-free continual learning before the introduction of CODA-Prompt."},
{"prior_sota_methods__involve__two_separate_optimizations": "The predicate \"involve\" indicates that these prior SOTA methods required or consisted of a specific process or procedure, in this case, two separate optimizations."},
